  "task": {
    "objective": "Route physical parcels to each owner private depot requirement. Delivery pays its beneficiary +1 and actual delivering courier +1/4. Actual bridge payments cost payer amount/16 reward; non-wait actions cost actor 1/128.",
    "natural_termination": "All three fixed parcel identities have been delivered to their correct depots, or truncate at 96 otherwise. At terminal, outstanding unused-slot deposits are cancelled and refunded.",
    "interaction": "Simultaneous bounded bids reserve one physical bridge entry slot, highest bid wins with rotating deterministic tie order, winner pays and losers recover deposits. Parcel swaps and consent-based transfers can save crossings. Posting an order changes other carriers available information.",
    "observation_access": "Private need[i] is observed only by agent i and is never a scene attribute. Posted orders, credits, escrow, payments, permit and delivery registration are public. Agent/active parcel payloads are visible within L1 radius 3. Delivery legal masks depend on any depot, never on hidden target correctness."
